tart, no exchange action, no deployment, no migration, no secret exposure, live gate remains blocked). Final marker line: `PHASE2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_REPORT_READY`. The body MUST NOT contain any harness BEGIN/END framing token marker line and MUST NOT contain a standalone END_FILE line.\n\n6. Emit `claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/automation_reliability/135_2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_GO_NO_GO.md` with EXACTLY this single line and trailing newline:\n   PHASE2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_PASSED\n   No other content. The body MUST NOT contain any harness BEGIN/END framing token marker line and MUST NOT contain a standalone END_FILE line.\n\nFailure path: if any precondition fails or any validation command returns non-zero or any forbidden-token sweep finds a match, write `PHASE2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_FAILED` to `claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/automation_reliability/135_2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_GO_NO_GO.md`, document the failure in `135_2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_REPORT.md`, do NOT touch the 09 marker, do NOT emit the 10 addendum, do NOT touch `claude_worklog/tools/reconcile_evidence_status.py`, and stop. Do NOT autofix in this task; the supervisor will dispatch a separate REQ_0007 / REQ_0014 autofix task scoped to the 09 marker plus the 10 addendum plus the two automation_reliability files plus the deterministic single-entry append.\n\nStop conditions: any live behavior, any Redis access, any legacy mutation, any release intent in any environment, any modification of any v2/ source or test file, any modification of any file under `v2/backend/app/domain/execution/`, any modification of any 2H.A artifact at 00 through 08, any modification of any 2G.A, 2G.B, 2G.C, 2F.A, 2F.B, 2F.C, 2E1, 2E2, or 2E3 source or test file, any modification of `v2/backend/app/services/paper_loop.py`, any modification of `v2/backend/tests/unit/__init__.py` or `v2/backend/tests/unit/domain/__init__.py`, any modification of the master planner prompt, any modification of any task definition under `claude_worklog/agent_supervisor/tasks/`, any rewrite of the EVIDENCE_MARKERS list ordering or any non-2H.A entry, any removal of an existing EVIDENCE_MARKERS entry, any modification of any def / class / helper / constant / import in `reconcile_evidence_status.py` beyond the deterministic single-entry append, any URL or credential leakage. On any of these, write `PHASE2H_A_EVIDENCE_RECONCILIATION_FAILED` markers and stop.",
