n  PHASE2E1C_GAMMA_TRAINER_PARITY_IMPL_BLOCKED\nNo other content. The file MUST NOT contain any END_FILE marker line.\n\nStep 9 - emit 93_2E1C_GAMMA_IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md with sections: 'Files authored' (list of paths), 'Public surface' (the 5 names from __init__), 'Behavior contract steps satisfied' (one row per spec 88 collect_stream_id_observations step 1-9 and one row per spec 88 extend_observation_history step 1-9), 'Forbidden-token self-grep results' (token => count), 'END_FILE marker self-grep result' (per scope a-d => count), 'py_compile result' (per file), 'pytest invocation' (full command, exit code, summary line for the gamma suite AND the alpha+beta+delta cross-isolation suite), 'Cross-isolation git-status check' (verbatim git status -s output for the alpha, beta, AND delta source trees, must be empty), 'Spec sections satisfied' (one row per spec 88 / spec 89 section). Final marker: PHASE2E1C_GAMMA_TRAINER_PARITY_IMPL_REPORT_READY. The file MUST NOT contain any END_FILE marker line.\n\nStep 10 - safety guarantees. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/domain/liveness_stream_growth/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness_composition/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/adapters/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/services/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/api/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/cli/. Do not modify any file under v2/backend/app/jobs/. Do not modify v2/backend/app/main.py. Do not modify legacy. Do not commit. Do not push. Do not run any subprocess other than pytest, python -m py_compile, python -c, git status -s, and grep / rg. Do not start the legacy trainer venv. Do not import any legacy module. Do not import any Redis client (no redis, aioredis, or redis.asyncio). Do not access network. Do not read .env. Do not enable final-live mode. Do not read or modify the master planner prompt under cl